   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,279:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CaiTI — Conversational AI Therapist Interface
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,292:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Overview
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,294:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CaiTI is a fully local, privacy-preserving smart-speaker system that delivers 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,297:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Motivational Interviewing (MI)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,299:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,300:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,302:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  micro-interventions. Built for the 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,303:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: NVIDIA Jetson
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,316:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  platform (Orin
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,327:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Nano/NX/AGX), the system operates entirely offline as a headless audio assistant. A Python-based speech-client
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,328:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: loop communicates with a local Dialogue Engine powered by 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,329:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gemma 4 E2B
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,331:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  running in-process via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,332:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LiteRT-LM
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,333:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — no
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,350:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: external server required.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,352:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Model Info
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,353:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gemma 4 E2B (LiteRT)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,369:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The Gemma 4 E2B is a lightweight, state-of-the-art open model from Google, built on the same research as the
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,372:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gemini family. This version is optimized for on-device, offline inference on edge hardware like the NVIDIA Jetson
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,373:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Orin Nano.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,374:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Property | Value |
