   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,405:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Tech Stack
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,406:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The model utilizes the 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,407:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LiteRT-LM
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,408:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  orchestration layer, which sits atop Google
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,409:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,411:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s high-performance LiteRT runtime.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,413:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: On Jetson hardware, it leverages:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,414:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,415:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: XNNPack
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,419:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Hardware acceleration for CPU execution
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,421:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ML Drift
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,423:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Hardware acceleration for GPU execution
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Memory Mapping
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,427:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Uses mmap for embedding parameters (1.12 GB) to reduce active working
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,428:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: memory footprint
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,430:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Jetson Orin Nano Benchmarks
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,432:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Performance metrics captured using 1024 prefill tokens and 256 decode tokens:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,435:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Backend | Prefill (T/s) | Decode (T/s) | Time-to-First-Token | Memory (MB) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,437:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,439:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |---------|--------------|--------------|---------------------|-------------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,440:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,442:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | GPU (ML Drift) | 1,142 | 24.2 | 0.9s | 2,739 |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | CPU
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: (4 Threads) | 109 | 12.2 | 9.4s | 3,681 |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The GPU backend provides a 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,453:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10x improvement
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  in prefill speed and significantly lower latency (TTFT) compared
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,458:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: to CPU on Jetson Orin Nano.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Key Features for IoT 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Edge
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Privacy
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Complete local execution with no internet connection required
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,473:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Advanced Capabilities
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,474:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Native support for KV-cache management, prompt templating, and
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,475:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: function calling
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,479:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Small Footprint
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,482:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Highly optimized for devices with limited RAM; vision and audio modules load
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,484:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: dynamically as needed
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,487:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Design Philosophy
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The architecture is built on three pillars:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,492:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Clinical Observability
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,505:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Every conversational turn records RL Q-values, semantic scores, and
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,510:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: validation flags to a structured SQLite database and per-session JSON/CSV logs. Researchers can
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,511:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: audit exactly 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: why
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  the AI chose a specific clinical dimension. Sessions are logged independently to 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,517:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: data/logs/[UserID]/[Timestamp].{log,json}
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,518:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,519:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Edge Privacy
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,522:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — By using 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,525:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: faster-whisper
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,527:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , lightweight local SER (MFCC-RF), 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,527:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Piper
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,538:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , and
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,548:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: in-process LiteRT-LM inference, sensitive patient data never leaves the device. The expensive LLM
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,550:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: layer is triggered only upon confirmed speech intent.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,551:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,553:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Sandboxed State Management
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,554:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Strict session lifecycle prevents 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,555:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,556:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: user-leakage.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,557:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,575:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  On session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,583:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: termination, RL memory (Pandas DataFrames) and screening state are explicitly purged, ensuring
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,585:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the next user starts with a clean slate seeded only from their historic database context.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: System Architecture
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,588:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: High-Level Data Flow
