   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,791:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: tracking, module init profiling, KV cache estimation)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,793:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:     ├── io_record.py           # IPC queues, session state, CSV/JSON
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,794:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: logging
