   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,802:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Core Components (Detailed)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,804:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1. Audio Perception Pipeline (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,805:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/drivers/audio.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,806:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,808:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/models/stt.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,809:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,811:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,812:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: AudioRecorder
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,815:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  captures audio via PyAudio with WebRTC-VAD for voice activity detection:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,815:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,816:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configurable VAD aggressiveness (0-3), sample rate (16kHz), and chunk size (480 frames)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,817:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,818:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ALSA warning suppression via ctypes for clean Jetson operation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,818:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,819:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: OS buffer flushing on stream start to avoid echo from recent TTS playback
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,820:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,821:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: VAD callback hooks to the GPIO LED for visual feedback
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,821:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,822:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Response-completion detection
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,827:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 2.0s sustained silence threshold with 0.4s trailing pad to catch
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,828:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: trailing words. If speech resumes during the trailing window, recording automatically extends
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,828:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,829:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Fragment filtering
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,830:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Recordings shorter than 0.3s of speech are discarded as noise/false positives
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: When speech is captured, 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STTGenerator
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,832:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  performs a memory-aware sequential pipeline serialized via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,833:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: inference_guard.heavy_stage()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,834:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,834:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,835:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Faster-Whisper STT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,835:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,836:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: faster-whisper
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,837:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) produces the transcript with low-memory decode
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,838:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: settings
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,838:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,839:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Lightweight SER
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,840:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,841:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: light_ser.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,842:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — MFCC random-forest-style voting) classifies vocal emotion
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,842:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,843:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Cache is explicitly cleared between STT and SER phases via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,844:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: clear_inference_cache()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,845:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Both results are packaged as 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,846:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {"transcript": "...", "detected_emotion": "..."}
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,854:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and pushed
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,855:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: onto the 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,856:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: INPUT_QUEUE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,858:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: . The SER backend is selectable via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,869:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SER_BACKEND
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,870:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  env var (defaults to 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,871:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: light_mfcc_rf
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,872:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ).
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,874:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: VRAM Shielding
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,876:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : On 8GB Jetson, Whisper and the LLM cannot coexist in VRAM. 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STTGenerator
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,879:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  exposes 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,881:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: suspend_all()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,882:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  / 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: resume_all()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,893:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  methods that fully unload both the Whisper model and SER classifier before
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,897:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the LLM inference, then reload them afterward. RSS deltas are logged at each transition.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,898:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Environment Verification
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,899:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : On import, 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,900:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stt.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,901:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  checks for the heavy 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,902:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: openai-whisper
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,905:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  package (which pulls
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,906:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ~2GB PyTorch). If detected, the process exits immediately with 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,906:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: [ENVIRONMENT ERROR]
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,907:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and instructions to
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: uninstall.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,909:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1b. Clinical Context Manager (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,910:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/context_manager.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,911:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,913:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ClinicalContextManager
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,914:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  maintains a rolling clinical summary that survives LLM context trimming:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,915:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,924:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Every 4 turns, a background LLM call extracts screening scores, RL focus areas, key behavioral
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,926:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: facts, and emotional trend into a concise bulleted summary
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,927:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,928:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The summary is auto-prepended to the LLM system prompt via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,930:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: inject_into_prompt()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,936:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , so
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,938:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the model always has a clinical snapshot regardless of how aggressively the context window is
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,939:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: trimmed
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,940:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,941:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Provides 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,942:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: generate_closing_reflection()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,948:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — an LLM-generated 2-3 sentence spoken
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,951:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: summary referencing specific session topics, scores, and feelings, delivered before the goodbye
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,952:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sequence
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,954:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,956:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Thread-safe singleton with explicit 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,958:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: reset()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,963:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  on session end
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,964:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 1c. Intermission Ladder Manager (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,966:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/intermission_manager.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,967:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,969:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,970:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IntermissionLadderManager
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,972:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  provides a strict stage progression used by the speech service when the
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,973:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LLM is thinking:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,973:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,974:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IntermissionTracker
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,979:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Manages PHQ-4 screening question state (PENDING / ANSWERED /
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,983:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SKIPPED) with no-repeat guarantees. Supports checkpoint restore from DB to survive mid-session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,985:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: restarts
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,986:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,987:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IntermissionLadderManager
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,988:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Strict 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,989:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SCREENING → BREATHING_EXERCISE → MUSIC
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,994:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,998:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stage progression. Screening advances when all 4 PHQ-4 questions are resolved; breathing exercises
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:43,999:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: are drawn from a no-repeat pool (5 meditations)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,000:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,001:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Decoupled from 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,002:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: speech_service.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,003:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  so the state machine logic is independently testable
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,004:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 2. Speech Interaction Service (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,005:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/services/speech_service.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,006:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,006:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,007:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SpeechInteractionService
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,009:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  orchestrates the real-time client loop with explicit state tracking (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,009:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: idle
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,010:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,010:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: onboarding
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,011:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,011:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: main_listen
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,012:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,013:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: main_process
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,014:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,017:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: intermission_screening
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,018:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,019:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: intermission_exercise
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,020:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,021:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: music_fallback
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,022:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,023:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: speaking
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,024:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ):
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,024:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,026:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Idle State
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,027:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Polls 1-second audio windows for wake-word detection (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,028:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,029:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Hello CaiTI
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,030:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,031:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,031:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,033:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Hey Katie
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,034:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,035:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,036:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: etc.)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,037:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,038:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Onboarding
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,041:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : On wake-word or GPIO Button 1, asks for user name, initializes session immediately
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,042:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,043:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: io_record.reset_session()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,044:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: . A multi-layer 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,045:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Name Guard
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,046:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  rejects common fillers (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,047:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,047:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Of
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,048:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: course
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,049:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,050:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,051:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,052:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Good morning
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,053:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,053:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,055:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,056:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: I
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,057:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,058:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: m fine
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,058:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,062:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) using word and phrase blacklists, minimum character
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,063:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: thresholds, and prefix stripping (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,064:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,065:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: My name is...
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,066:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,067:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  -> name only)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,067:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,068:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Active Session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,070:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Turn-based loop — the first agent utterance is dequeued from 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,072:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: OUTPUT_QUEUE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,081:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,089:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: spoken. Subsequent turns cycle: listen -> send input -> VRAM handoff -> intermission (speaks next
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,091:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: response) -> loop back to listen. This avoids the deadlock where 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,094:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: output_queue.get()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,096:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  blocks
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,098:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: while the handler waits for input
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,099:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,100:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Sequential VRAM Handoff
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,102:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : After the user speaks, the service (1) unloads both Whisper and SER
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,103:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,104:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stt.suspend_all()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,109:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , (2) waits 0.3s for OS memory reclamation, (3) lets the LLM inference
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,112:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: proceed, then (4) reloads models for the next listen cycle
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,113:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,114:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: STT Retry Logic
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,118:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Short transcripts (1-2 words) trigger a brief continuation listen (4s) to merge split
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,119:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: utterances into a single coherent response
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,120:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Intermission State Machine
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,122:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: If the LLM takes longer than 3 seconds, a state machine engages the user:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,123:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: WAITING (silent, < 3s) -> SCREENING -> EXERCISE -> MUSIC
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,126:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                             |             |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,127:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                          (opt-out)     (opt-out)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,128:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                             +------+------+
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,129:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                                    v
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,130:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:                                  MUSIC
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,131:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | State | Behavior |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,132:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,133:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |-------|----------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,134:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,135:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,136:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SCREENING
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,139:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Cycles through all 4 PHQ-4 questions without repeats. STT is
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,140:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: briefly resumed to capture the user
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,142:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,143:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s spoken answer. Supports 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,145:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,147:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: repeat
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,148:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,151:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  requests, opt-out, and gentle re-prompts on
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,152:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: silence (12s timeout) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,153:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,154:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: EXERCISE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,159:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Cycles through 5 guided breathing exercises with 30s hold time per exercise.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,160:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: When all 5 are used, the pool resets and cycles again |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,161:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,162:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,163:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: MUSIC
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,164:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Plays ambient music (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,165:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: assets/waiting_music.wav
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,167:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) as a final fallback. Entered when the user opts out or all exercises are
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,168:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: exhausted |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,169:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: User can say 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,169:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,170:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: skip
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,171:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,172:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,173:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,174:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stop
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,175:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,176:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , or 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,177:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,178:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: opt out
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,179:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,185:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  at any time to jump to music. When the LLM response arrives, the current
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,187:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sentence finishes naturally, a randomized bridge phrase provides a smooth transition, then the therapist
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,188:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,189:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s response is
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,189:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: delivered.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,191:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,192:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Modes
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,194:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,195:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: hands_free
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,197:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (auto-listen after agent speaks) or 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,198:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: manual
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,199:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (wait for 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,201:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: manual_input_event
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,203:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,205:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,207:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Voice Commands
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,207:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,208:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,210:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: end session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,211:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,212:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  / 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,213:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,214:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stop session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,215:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,216:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  triggers immediate session termination
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,217:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,220:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Hardware Events
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,222:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : GPIO buttons for Start/End/Opt-Out are polled each loop iteration
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,224:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 3. Reinforcement Learning Orchestrator (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,225:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/handler_rl.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,227:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,229:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: HandlerRL
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,231:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  is the main clinical pipeline coordinator:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,232:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,233:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Setup
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,235:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Loads question library JSON, initializes Q-table from 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,237:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ITEM_IMPORTANCE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,239:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  weights, loads
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,240:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: persistent Q-table if one exists for the subject
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,241:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,241:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Greeting
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,243:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : LLM-generated personalized greeting incorporating user context from prior sessions
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,243:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,244:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: RL Screening Loop
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,244:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,245:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,245:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: choose_action()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,248:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  selects the next clinical dimension (37 possible: mood, sleep,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,248:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: weight, etc.) using epsilon-greedy Q-learning
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,249:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,250:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ask_question()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,251:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  delivers the question, collects response, classifies it
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,252:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,253:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Q-table is updated via standard Q-learning: 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,254:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Q(s,a) += alpha * (target -
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,255:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: predict)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,256:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,259:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: RL decisions (state, action, Q-values, mask) are logged to the DB as reasoning
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,260:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: events
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,261:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,263:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CBT Trigger
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,265:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : After screening, dimensions scoring 2 (severe) are offered for CBT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,267:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,268:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Post-Session
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,270:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Clinical summary generation, session analysis (safety flags, preferences), Q-table
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,271:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: persistence, memory purge
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,272:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4. Question Delivery 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,273:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,274:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Classification (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,275:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/questioner.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,276:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,277:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/response_analyzer.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,278:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,279:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Questioner
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,280:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: :
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,281:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,283:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Selects question variants from the library, optionally rephrases via LLM
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,285:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,286:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Classifies user response segments through 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,287:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ResponseBridge
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,289:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  -> 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,290:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ResponseAnalyzer
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,291:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,293:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Handles invalid responses with an LLM-generated retry guide (clarification, angle-shift, or
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,295:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: restatement)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,297:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,299:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Invokes 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,302:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ReflectionValidation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,304:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  for follow-up relevance checking
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,306:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ResponseAnalyzer
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,306:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,308:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: classify_dimension_and_score
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,309:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ):
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,309:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,311:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LLM-based classifier maps user text to one of 37 clinical dimensions + a severity score (0/1/2)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,312:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,313:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Also handles general responses: Yes, No, Maybe, Question, Stop
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,313:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,314:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Includes 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,315:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: reflective_summarizer
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,316:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,317:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: rephrase_question
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,318:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  for natural conversation flow
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,319:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5. Response Bridge 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,319:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,320:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Intermission Engine (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,321:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/services/response_bridge.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,322:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,323:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DLA Parsing
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,325:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Robust parser handling multiple LLM output formats — plain text (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,326:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: talk, 1
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,327:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ), JSON (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,328:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: {"res":
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,329:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "talk, 1"}
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,331:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ), prefixed (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,333:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DLA_3_talk, 1
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,334:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) — with cascading fallback logic.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,336:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IntermissionManager
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,340:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Thread-safe interstitial content manager used by 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,341:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: llm_complete_with_interstitial()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,346:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  for pipeline-internal LLM waits (e.g., reflection validation, CBT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,347:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: reasoning). Persists screening scores to DB and triggers clinical flags:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,348:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,349:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: GAD2_POSITIVE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,350:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  when anxiety >= 3
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,351:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,352:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PHQ4_HIGH_RISK
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,353:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  when total >= 6
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,355:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The primary user-facing intermission runs in 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,356:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: speech_service.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,360:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (see Section 2 above), which uses its own
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,362:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: state machine with voice interaction, STT resume/suspend, and opt-out handling.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,364:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 6. Reflection Validation Module (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,366:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/reflection_validation.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,367:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,370:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Validates follow-up responses for topical relevance using a consolidated LLM prompt:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,372:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,375:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Decision 0 (Related)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,377:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Returns empathetic 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,379:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: VALIDATION
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,380:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  text, prepended to next question
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,382:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Decision 1 (Unrelated)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,383:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Returns a 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: GUIDE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,385:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  to steer user back on topic, then re-collects response
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,386:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,387:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Uses 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,388:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: llm_complete_with_interstitial
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,389:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  so the intermission engine covers latency
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,391:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 7. CBT Protocol (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,393:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/core/CBT.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,396:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: A 4-stage Cognitive Behavioral Therapy protocol triggered when any dimension receives severity score 2:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,397:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Stage | Name | Action |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,398:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,399:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |-------|------|--------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,400:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,401:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 0 | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,401:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Select
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,403:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | User chooses which severe dimension to work on |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,404:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,405:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 1 | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,407:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Identify
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,408:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | User identifies unhelpful thoughts; LLM 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,410:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: reasons
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,411:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  + 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,411:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: guides
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,412:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (up to 2 retries) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,413:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,413:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 2 | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,414:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Challenge
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,416:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | User
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,418:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: challenges those thoughts; LLM validates with cognitive distortion awareness |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,419:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,420:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 3 | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,421:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Reframe
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | User reframes
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: thoughts; preceded by LLM-recap of their challenge |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,427:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Each stage uses a 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,428:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Reasoner
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,429:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (validates user input, returns DECISION 0/1) and a 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,430:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Guide
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,438:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (provides therapeutic
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: direction on failure). The system tracks 13 cognitive distortions (filtering, catastrophizing, polarized thinking, etc.).
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,444:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: All CBT progress is recorded in the question library
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,445:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: notes
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,447:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  field.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 8. LLM Client (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/models/llm_client.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,449:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,450:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Unified LLM interface with three calling modes:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Function | Behavior |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |----------|----------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,453:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: llm_complete()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Synchronous in-process LiteRT-LM inference (via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: litert_lm.Engine
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,458:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: llm_complete_async()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Background thread pool execution |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,465:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: llm_complete_with_interstitial()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,467:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Async + intermission engine for latency coverage |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,468:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: All calls automatically inject:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: User context
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (preferences + session summaries from DB)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,472:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Context pack
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,474:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (latest transcript, emotion tag, RL state, screening scores)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,475:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Context injection can be disabled via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,478:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: DISABLE_CONTEXT_HISTORY=1
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,480:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  for diagnostic isolation
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,481:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Gemma Chat Template
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,484:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Since Gemma has no native system role, the system prompt is folded into the user turn
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,485:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: using the 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,487:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <start_of_turn>user
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,488:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  / 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: <start_of_turn>model
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  template format.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,492:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Lazy Singleton Engine
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : The LiteRT-LM inference engine (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,493:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: litert_lm.Engine
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,502:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) is initialized on first call with
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,509:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: thread-safe locking. CPU backend (XNNPack) is the default; GPU backend (ML Drift) is used when available and
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,511:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: configured via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,512:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LITERT_BACKEND=gpu
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,514:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Context Governance
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : A sliding-window trimmer ensures the combined prompt stays within 75% of 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,516:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LITERT_CONTEXT_LENGTH
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,517:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: . Injected context is trimmed from the tail while core instructions at the head are
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,518:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: preserved.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,520:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Memory Monitoring
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,534:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Logs system memory snapshot (RAM, GPU sysfs telemetry) before and after each inference
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,536:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: call. A heartbeat thread logs every 10s during inference so the terminal never appears dead.
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,562:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 8a. Inference Guard (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,563:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/utils/inference_guard.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,564:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,566:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Serializes heavy inference stages (STT, SER, LLM) to prevent concurrent GPU/memory contention on
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,567:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: resource-constrained Jetson hardware:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,569:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,570:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: heavy_stage(name)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,574:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Context manager with a global threading lock ensuring only one heavy
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,575:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: inference runs at a time
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,576:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,578:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: clear_inference_cache(reason)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,580:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Best-effort cleanup between phases — runs 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,582:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: gc.collect()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,583:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  and optionally 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,585:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: torch.cuda.empty_cache()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  when PyTorch is available
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,588:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: get_system_memory_snapshot()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,589:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Clinical-grade memory transparency combining system
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,590:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: RAM (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,591:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: free -h
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,593:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) and GPU telemetry (priority: sysfs zero-cost reads -> 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,594:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: nvidia-smi
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,599:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  -> 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,601:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: tegrastats
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,603:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ). Sysfs reads GPU clock frequency and utilization directly from 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,605:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: /sys/class/devfreq/
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,606:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  on Jetson (Orin Nano, Orin NX, Xavier NX paths supported)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,608:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 8b. Lightweight SER (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,609:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/models/light_ser.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,610:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,611:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Pure-NumPy MFCC-based emotion classifier designed for memory-constrained devices:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,613:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,614:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Extracts 30-dimensional feature vector: 13 MFCC means + 13 MFCC stds + RMS mean/std + ZCR
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,615:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: mean/std
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,616:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,617:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: RMS auto-gain normalization
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,623:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Input audio is normalized to a target RMS of 0.1 before feature
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,625:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: extraction, preventing Jetson mic gain variance from inflating MFCC std features
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,625:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,626:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Silence gate
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,627:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Audio with raw RMS below 0.005 is immediately tagged as 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,628:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,629:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: neutral
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,630:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,634:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  without
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,636:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: classification, preventing noise-only buffers from triggering false anger detections
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,637:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,639:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Classifies into 4 emotions: neutral, happy, sad, angry via rule-based random-forest-style voting (15
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,640:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: decision stumps)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,640:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,641:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Adaptive anger calibration
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,644:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : A rolling 10-sample window tracks classification history. If 7+ of the
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,645:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: last 10 results are 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,645:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,646:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: angry
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,647:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,650:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , MFCC std thresholds are automatically raised by 10% to suppress
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,652:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: persistent mic-gain-induced anger bias
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,652:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,654:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Zero external ML dependencies — uses only NumPy and soundfile
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,654:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,655:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Configurable via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,656:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SER_BACKEND
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,658:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  env var (enabled when set to 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,659:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: light_mfcc_rf
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,659:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,660:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: mfcc_rf
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,661:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , or 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,661:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: lightweight
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,662:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,664:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 9. Database Layer (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,666:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/drivers/db_manager.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,667:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,668:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SQLite database (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,670:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: data/therapist.db
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,671:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) with 7 tables:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,672:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Table | Purpose |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,673:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,675:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |-------|---------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,676:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,677:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,678:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: users
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,679:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Subject IDs with creation timestamps |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,680:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,681:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,682:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sessions
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,684:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Session start/end
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,686:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: times linked to users |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,687:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,687:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,689:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: turns
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,690:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Full dialogue transcript with speaker, text, and JSON metadata |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,690:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,691:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,692:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: summaries
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,693:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,695:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: LLM-generated session summaries |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,696:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,697:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,698:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: user_preferences
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,700:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Extracted user preferences (key-value, upsert) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,701:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,702:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,703:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: safety_flags
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,705:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | Risk flags with severity (1-5 scale) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,707:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,708:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,709:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: clinical_screening
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,712:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | PHQ-4/GAD-2 sub-scores
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,713:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: with automatic clinical flag columns |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,715:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,716:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,717:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: feedback
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,718:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  | User feedback with optional turn-level granularity |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,720:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10. GPIO Hardware Interface (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,721:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/drivers/gpio_manager.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,722:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,723:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Singleton manager for Jetson GPIO with graceful degradation to no-op stubs on non-Jetson hardware:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,725:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | Pin (BOARD) | Function | Type |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,727:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,729:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: |-------------|----------|------|
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,730:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,733:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 11 | Start Session | Input (FALLING edge, 300ms
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,734:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: debounce) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,735:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,737:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 13 | End Session | Input (FALLING edge, 300ms debounce) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,738:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,741:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 15 | Opt-Out | Input (FALLING edge,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,743:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 300ms debounce) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,745:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,746:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 16 | Button 4 (spare) | Input (FALLING/RISING edge, 300ms debounce) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,747:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,749:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: | 18 | Listening LED |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,751:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Output (HIGH while recording) |
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,752:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Supports 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,754:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: per-pin active-low/active-high
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,755:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  configuration (via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,757:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PIN_BTN_*_ACTIVE_LOW
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,768:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  env vars), interrupt-based
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,771:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: detection with fallback level polling, and thread-safe event queue. The LED polarity is also configurable via 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,773:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: PIN_LISTENING_LED_ACTIVE_LOW
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,775:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,776:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 10a. Background Music Service (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,778:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/drivers/music_player.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,779:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,780:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,782:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: BackgroundMusicService
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,785:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  provides ambient therapeutic music during the music fallback intermission
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,787:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: stage:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,789:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,791:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Non-blocking loop thread using 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,793:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: pygame.mixer
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,795:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  with automatic fallback to 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,796:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: assets/audio/waiting_music.wav
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,798:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  if the primary track is unavailable
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,799:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,800:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Volume ducking
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,802:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : When the agent speaks, 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,803:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: duck()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,806:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  drops volume to 5% (configurable); 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,809:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: restore()
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,813:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  returns to 25% base volume. This allows music to continue under speech without
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,815:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: masking it
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,816:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,820:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Thread-safe start/stop lifecycle with lazy mixer initialization (pygame is only loaded when music is
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,822:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: actually needed)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,824:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 11. Configuration System (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,826:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/utils/config_loader.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,828:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,829:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Two-tier configuration:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,831:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: config.yaml
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,834:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Audio parameters, STT/TTS model paths, RL hyperparameters (epsilon, alpha,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,835:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: gamma, item
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,836:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: _
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,837:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: importance), database path, VAD aggressiveness
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,838:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,839:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .env
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,851:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Runtime secrets and host-specific overrides — LiteRT model path and backend, context length,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,853:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: max tokens, request timeout, SER backend selection, TTS pacing (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,854:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: length_scale
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,855:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: , 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,857:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: sentence_silence
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,858:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ), GPIO pin numbers, and per-pin active-low polarity flags
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,859:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 12. Session I/O 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,859:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,860:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Logging (
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,861:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: src/utils/io_record.py
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,862:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: )
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,863:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Central hub for session state and inter-process communication:
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,864:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,866:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: IPC Queues
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,867:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,867:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: INPUT_QUEUE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,869:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (user responses) and 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,870:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: OUTPUT_QUEUE
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,873:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  (agent questions) bridge the
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,875:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: speech service and clinical pipeline
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,876:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,877:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Session State
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,878:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,879:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: START_SESSION_EVENT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,882:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  / 
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,884:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: END_SESSION_EVENT
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,886:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  threading events, session ID,
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,887:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: turn index
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,888:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,889:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Context Pack
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,890:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Aggregates latest transcript, emotion, RL state, and screening scores for LLM
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,891:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: injection
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,892:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,893:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Multi-format Logging
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,897:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Simultaneous writes to SQLite DB, per-session CSV, per-session JSON
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,899:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: (newline-delimited), and terminal output
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,900:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,901:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Question Prefix
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,904:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: : Mechanism to prepend validation/recap text to the next agent question
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,907:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Project Structure
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,908:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: .
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,911:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ├── main.py                    # Application entrypoint (FastAPI +
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,912:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Flask dual-mode)
