   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,920:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: pins)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,921:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,922:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ├── src/                       # Source package (see Module
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,924:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Architecture above)
   DEBUG: 2026-04-16 15:40:44,926:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: │   ├── core/                  # Clinical domain logic
